If LV2 ever needs its own params_container_resync (it doesn't today -
plug->controls is fixed at load, no add/remove-ports mechanism in LV2
core or the patch/parameters/port-props extensions this app uses): its
uid would need to stop being ct_iter (position) and become the port/
control's SYMBOL hashed into a uint32_t instead - position is exactly
what goes unstable across a reconfiguration. Not automatic, a deliberate
plugins.c change.

