idx-enumerable list_at. TODO when built:
- DataChoice gains DATA_CHOICE_CATEGORY (1u << 1), alongside the existing
  DATA_CHOICE_LINKED (1u << 0) - a row with this bit set is a node to
  descend into, not a pickable leaf.
- DataActionReq gains a top-level field, sibling to `type`, OUTSIDE the
  per-action union: `uint64_t category_scope;` (0 = list root). Set by
