  handling already used by helper_choice_list_step's callers - category
  row updates category_scope/resets cursor and re-browses; leaf row
  behaves exactly as today. Backing out (h/ESC) needs a small caller-
  owned breadcrumb stack (scope, cursor) per level, capped like ACTION_
  ARG_COUNT elsewhere in this CLI - no heap.
- A category node's DataChoice.value must hash its FULL path (e.g.
  fnv1a64("Bass/Analog/Warm")), not just its own name, or two different
